    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d662">

                <pb facs="0778" n="704" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg704"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2917</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Leavell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-10-08T15:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 8, 1918, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received October 9, 1.30
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your circular telegram of September 20, 6 p.m. Guatemalan Minister for Foreign
                    Affairs has just now informed me that the Guatemalan Minister at Washington, D.
                    C, has been instructed to publish the protest of the Government of Guatemala in
                    the sense of above-mentioned circular telegram.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Leavell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
